<section class="slide closing-slide" id="s18" data-seconds="40" data-chapter="05 / Contributions &amp; discussion" data-title="Conclusion and main findings." data-note="讲述重点｜先用145例、3种机制、最大7.59pp回收三个贡献，再诚实点出最重要的construct/internal/external validity边界。最后一句：The result is a better first-file recommendation on this benchmark, with generalization and developer benefit still to be tested.

教授可能追问｜怎么安排下一步最有说服力？

答复依据与边界｜先重复匹配实验量化方差与效率，再做跨引擎、多文件评估，最后做developer study。输入防泄漏不等于排除预训练污染；也不要声称本研究已经节省真实开发时间。"  aria-label="19: Conclusion and main findings." tabindex="-1">
<div class="slide-top"><span>TECHNICAL UNIVERSITY OF MUNICH <i>/</i> CHAIR OF SOFTWARE ENGINEERING &amp; AI</span><img class="tum-wordmark" src="images/tum_logo.png" alt="TUM"></div>
<header class="slide-heading"><div class="eyebrow">05 / Contributions &amp; discussion</div><h1>Conclusion and main findings.</h1></header>
<div class="slide-body">

<div class="defense-closing"><div class="conclusion-evidence"><span class="label"></span><div class="closing-result"><strong>IR</strong><p>First systematic evaluation<br><b>Execution-free fault localization for LLM inference-engine bugs.</b></p></div><div class="closing-result"><strong>Agent</strong><p>Repository-derived OllamaFLBench<br><b>145 validated Ollama issue–fix pairs with pre-fix snapshots.</b></p></div><div class="closing-result"><strong>ClueFL</strong><p>Domain-specific ClueFL framework<br><b>External knowledge and workflow improve fault-location ranking.</b></p></div><div class="closing-signature"><span>Evaluate systematically → Release reusable data → Improve with domain knowledge</span><button class="text-button" data-go="29">Supporting evidence →</button></div></div></div>

</div>
<footer class="slide-footer"><span>24<span class="footer-total"> / 24</span></span></footer>
</section><section class="slide " id="s19" data-chapter="Backup / Method details" data-title="BugLocator: two evidence channels, one ranking." data-note="讲述重点｜按文件文本证据与历史证据两路解释融合，不逐个朗读预处理框。

教授可能追问｜是否是原版BugLocator，历史如何防泄漏？

答复依据与边界｜论文是多语言适配实现；两路分数分别min–max归一化，以alpha=0.2融合；其历史修复需早于目标issue创建。" data-backup="true" aria-label="B01: BugLocator: two evidence channels, one ranking." tabindex="-1">
<div class="slide-top"><span>TECHNICAL UNIVERSITY OF MUNICH <i>/</i> CHAIR OF SOFTWARE ENGINEERING &amp; AI</span><img class="tum-wordmark" src="images/tum_logo.png" alt="TUM"></div>
<header class="slide-heading"><div class="eyebrow">Backup / Method details</div><h1>BugLocator: two evidence channels, one ranking.</h1></header>
<div class="slide-body"><figure class="paper-figure backup-method"><button class="figure-zoom" data-figure="images/fig4-2-buglocator.svg" data-caption="Fig. 4.2 · Multilingual BugLocator adaptation · p. 22" data-page="32" aria-label="Enlarge: Original Figure 4.2: multilingual BugLocator adaptation with file retrieval and leakage-safe history-informed evidence fused into a ranking."><img src="images/fig4-2-buglocator.svg" alt="Original Figure 4.2: multilingual BugLocator adaptation with file retrieval and leakage-safe history-informed evidence fused into a ranking." draggable="false"><span class="zoom-hint">↗ Enlarge original</span></button><figcaption>BugLocator multilingual adaptation [1]</figcaption></figure></div>

